   "text": "**Q4 (i) log x = 0.0065**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\log x=0.0065\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Characteristic }=0,\\text{ Mantissa }=0.0065\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Mantissa }0.0065\\to \\text{ row }.00,\\text{ column }6=\\\\[5pt]&\\quad 1014;\\text{ mean difference}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{(row }.00,\\text{ column }5)=1\\\\[5pt]&1014+1=1015\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Characteristic }=0\\to 1\\text{ digit(s) before}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{the decimal point}\\\\[5pt]&x=\\operatorname{antilog}(0.0065)=1.015\\end{aligned}\\]",
